      "filename": "\"The Cambrian\" - geograph.org.uk - 904336.jpg",
      "title": "File:\"The Cambrian\" - geograph.org.uk - 904336.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/%22The_Cambrian%22_-_geograph.org.uk_-_904336.jpg",
