      "filename": "The site of the original Aberystwith and Welsh Coast Railway Pwllheli station - geograph.org.uk - 1029039.jpg",
      "title": "File:The site of the original Aberystwith and Welsh Coast Railway Pwllheli station - geograph.org.uk - 1029039.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/The_site_of_the_original_Aberystwith_and_Welsh_Coast_Railway_Pwllheli_station_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1029039.jpg",
